  "prompt": "Use case: identity-preserve. Create ONE independently articulated animation frame of the SAME chibi boy in image1. Image1 is same-direction idle identity/construction/camera reference ONLY; redraw the exact NEW casting pose below. Image2 is PRIMARY approved bright clean rounded Daoist chibi hand-painted style; ignore UI. Preserve the same side-profile face, brown tousled high tied hair, yin-yang jade gold ornament, plain teal ribbon, forehead diamond, charcoal gold-cloud short robe, ivory lining, jade yin-yang belt, black gold boots. Anatomical RIGHT hand grips ONE large black brush with white bristles and dark tip; one teal tassel hangs from HANDLE BUTT behind fist, never bristle collar. Anatomical LEFT hand holds ONE hanging BLANK ivory scroll with black gold rods and yin-yang charm. Exactly TWO pale cyan ink spirits beside scroll. Real separate fingers, two clearly articulated feet, no extra limbs or objects. Full body square actual transparent alpha PNG at least 1024x1024, ideally1254. Match image1 global head/body scale and camera; equivalent ground y1155 on1254, fixed feet for cast. Independently draw this pose, no copy/mirror/interpolation. Clear transparent edge with no colored fringe. No writing, particles, trails, ground or large effects.\nFRAME POSE (implement actual new joint positions; retain all above invariants): cast/E/03. RIGHT side profile. Raise the blank scroll in the anatomical left hand to mid-chest height and present its blank surface obliquely right. Anatomical right elbow lifts outward a little, brush upright beside the forward shoulder with wrist relaxed for a coming stroke. Chin tilts slightly upward and knee bend deepens just a fraction. Exactly two spirits hover beside the scroll at distinct heights, upper one upright and lower one curving toward its edge. Keep shoes planted.\nImportant construction: do NOT copy the tassel at the idle brush's old position near the back of his head. Move the single brush tassel with the butt-cap beside the RIGHT WRIST, physically attached behind the fist. No beads/tassel on hair ribbon; no detached tassel. The TWO spirits are simple figures with no floating droplets or exclamation marks.",
